  "description": "Kiss more, win more!\nSeung-A's a lifelong baseball fan, but she's on the verge of calling it quits. Her team, the Futures Victory, is on a notoriously long losing streak — until she kisses a fellow fan, and the Futures happen to win. Now back in the game, the two get intimate to push the Futures up the ranks...\n\n(Source: Manta)\n\n*Note: Includes an epilogue and 3 extra chapters.*",
